## Notes

- The script uses [Nominatim](https://nominatim.org/) for geocoding. Please respect their usage policy and avoid excessive requests.
- If you have a large list, the script waits 1 second between requests to avoid rate limiting.
- You can change the map style by editing the `tiles` parameter in the script.

